<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>NLP → Reasoning Model Mastery Roadmap</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #07080a;
    --bg2: #0d0f12;
    --bg3: #12151a;
    --surface: #161b22;
    --surface2: #1c2330;
    --border: #21282f;
    --border2: #2d3748;
    --text: #e8edf5;
    --text2: #8b96a8;
    --text3: #4a5568;
    --accent: #3b82f6;
    --accent2: #60a5fa;
    --green: #10b981;
    --orange: #f59e0b;
    --purple: #8b5cf6;
    --pink: #ec4899;
    --red: #ef4444;
    --cyan: #06b6d4;

    --cat-math: #f59e0b;
    --cat-fundamentals: #10b981;
    --cat-classical: #06b6d4;
    --cat-embeddings: #8b5cf6;
    --cat-neural: #3b82f6;
    --cat-transformers: #ec4899;
    --cat-llm: #f97316;
    --cat-training: #84cc16;
    --cat-finetuning: #a78bfa;
    --cat-rl: #fb923c;
    --cat-reasoning: #34d399;
    --cat-generation: #38bdf8;
    --cat-applications: #fb7185;
    --cat-multimodal: #c084fc;
    --cat-deployment: #fbbf24;
    --cat-agents: #4ade80;
    --cat-eval: #f472b6;
    --cat-interpretability: #818cf8;
    --cat-advanced: #e879f9;
    --cat-courses: #67e8f9;
    --cat-blogs: #86efac;
    --cat-youtube: #fca5a5;
    --cat-tools: #d1d5db;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* ─── NOISE TEXTURE ─── */
  body::before {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noise'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noise)' opacity='0.04'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  /* ─── HEADER ─── */
  header {
    position: relative;
    padding: 80px 60px 60px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .header-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -100px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 800px;
    height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(59,130,246,0.12) 0%, rgba(139,92,246,0.08) 40%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .header-tag {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .header-tag::before {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    width: 20px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 72px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8edf5 0%, #8b96a8 60%, #3b82f6 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .header-sub {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text2);
    max-width: 600px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .stats-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .stat-num {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--text3);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  /* ─── NAV ─── */
  nav {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(7,8,10,0.92);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 0 60px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scrollbar-width: none;
  }

  nav::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }

  .nav-item {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text3);
    cursor: pointer;
    white-space: nowrap;
    border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .nav-item:hover { color: var(--text2); }
  .nav-item.active { color: var(--text); border-bottom-color: var(--accent); }

  /* ─── CONTROLS BAR ─── */
  .controls {
    padding: 24px 60px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg2);
  }

  .search-wrap {
    position: relative;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 240px;
    max-width: 400px;
  }

  .search-icon {
    position: absolute;
    left: 14px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    color: var(--text3);
    font-size: 14px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  input[type="text"] {
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 14px 10px 38px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  input[type="text"]:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }
  input[type="text"]::placeholder { color: var(--text3); }

  .filter-group {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .filter-btn {
    padding: 6px 14px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--text2);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s;
    white-space: nowrap;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .filter-btn:hover { border-color: var(--border2); color: var(--text); }
  .filter-btn.active { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #fff; }

  .results-count {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text3);
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  /* ─── ROADMAP SECTION ─── */
  .roadmap-section {
    padding: 60px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .section-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--text3);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .section-label::after {
    content: '';
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--border);
  }

  .roadmap-phases {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .phase-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 28px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .phase-card:hover { background: var(--surface2); }

  .phase-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 2px;
  }

  .phase-card:nth-child(1)::before { background: var(--cat-math); }
  .phase-card:nth-child(2)::before { background: var(--cat-fundamentals); }
  .phase-card:nth-child(3)::before { background: var(--cat-classical); }
  .phase-card:nth-child(4)::before { background: var(--cat-embeddings); }
  .phase-card:nth-child(5)::before { background: var(--cat-neural); }
  .phase-card:nth-child(6)::before { background: var(--cat-transformers); }
  .phase-card:nth-child(7)::before { background: var(--cat-llm); }
  .phase-card:nth-child(8)::before { background: var(--cat-finetuning); }
  .phase-card:nth-child(9)::before { background: var(--cat-rl); }
  .phase-card:nth-child(10)::before { background: var(--cat-reasoning); }

  .phase-num {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--text3);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .phase-title {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .phase-desc {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text2);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .phase-topics {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .phase-topic-tag {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--bg3);
    color: var(--text3);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  /* ─── MAIN CONTENT ─── */
  .main-content {
    padding: 60px;
  }

  /* ─── CATEGORY BLOCK ─── */
  .category-block {
    margin-bottom: 64px;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .category-block.hidden { display: none; }

  .category-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .cat-dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .cat-title {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .cat-count {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text3);
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  /* ─── SUBCATEGORY ─── */
  .subcategory {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .subcat-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--text3);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    padding-left: 2px;
  }

  /* ─── TOPIC ROW ─── */
  .topics-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(340px, 1fr));
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .topic-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 0;
    border-radius: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: background 0.15s;
  }

  .topic-card:hover { background: var(--surface2); }

  .topic-card.hidden { display: none; }

  .topic-header {
    padding: 16px 18px 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .topic-name {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    line-height: 1.3;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .expand-icon {
    color: var(--text3);
    font-size: 14px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }

  .topic-card.expanded .expand-icon { transform: rotate(90deg); }

  .topic-resources {
    display: none;
    padding: 0 18px 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .topic-card.expanded .topic-resources { display: block; }

  .resource-item {
    padding: 10px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .resource-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .resource-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .resource-type {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 9px;
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 1px;
  }

  .type-paper { background: rgba(59,130,246,0.15); color: #60a5fa; }
  .type-book { background: rgba(16,185,129,0.15); color: #34d399; }
  .type-article { background: rgba(245,158,11,0.15); color: #fbbf24; }
  .type-course { background: rgba(139,92,246,0.15); color: #a78bfa; }
  .type-youtube { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.15); color: #f87171; }
  .type-blog { background: rgba(20,184,166,0.15); color: #2dd4bf; }
  .type-doc { background: rgba(156,163,175,0.15); color: #9ca3af; }
  .type-dataset { background: rgba(249,115,22,0.15); color: #fb923c; }
  .type-leaderboard { background: rgba(236,72,153,0.15); color: #f472b6; }
  .type-other { background: rgba(100,116,139,0.15); color: #94a3b8; }

  .resource-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.4;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .resource-meta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .resource-author {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--text3);
  }

  .resource-link {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    word-break: break-all;
  }

  .resource-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  .resource-note {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text3);
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-style: italic;
    padding-top: 2px;
  }

  /* ─── PROGRESS ─── */
  .progress-bar-wrap {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 2px;
    z-index: 200;
    background: var(--border);
  }

  .progress-bar {
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--purple));
    width: 0%;
    transition: width 0.1s;
  }

  /* ─── BACK TO TOP ─── */
  .back-top {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 32px;
    right: 32px;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    background: var(--surface2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border2);
    border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--text2);
    font-size: 16px;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 50;
  }

  .back-top.visible { opacity: 1; pointer-events: all; }
  .back-top:hover { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; border-color: var(--accent); }

  /* ─── FOOTER ─── */
  footer {
    padding: 40px 60px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: gap;
    background: var(--bg2);
  }

  .footer-text {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text3);
  }

  /* ─── RESPONSIVE ─── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    header, .roadmap-section, .main-content { padding: 32px 24px; }
    nav { padding: 0 24px; }
    .controls { padding: 16px 24px; }
    footer { padding: 24px; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
    .topics-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .roadmap-phases { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    h1 { font-size: 32px; }
    .stats-row { gap: 20px; }
  }

  /* ─── ANIMATIONS ─── */
  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .category-block {
    animation: fadeUp 0.4s ease forwards;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="progress-bar-wrap"><div class="progress-bar" id="progressBar"></div></div>

<!-- HEADER -->
<header>
  <div class="header-glow"></div>
  <div class="header-tag">Complete Curriculum 2025</div>
  <h1>NLP → Reasoning<br>Model Mastery</h1>
  <p class="header-sub">Everything you need to go from NLP fundamentals to building Claude-level reasoning capabilities — math, papers, books, courses, and code resources in one place.</p>
  <div class="stats-row">
    <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num" id="totalTopics">0</span><span class="stat-label">Unique Topics</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num" id="totalResources">0</span><span class="stat-label">Resources</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num">22</span><span class="stat-label">Categories</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num">10</span><span class="stat-label">Phases</span></div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav id="mainNav">
  <div class="nav-item active" onclick="scrollToSection('roadmap')">Roadmap</div>
  <div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('math')">Math</div>
  <div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('fundamentals')">Fundamentals</div>
  <div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('classical')">Classical NLP</div>
  <div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('embeddings')">Embeddings</div>
  <div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('neural')">Neural</div>
  <div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('transformers')">Transformers</div>
  <div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('llm')">LLMs</div>
  <div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('finetuning')">Fine-tuning</div>
  <div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('rl')">RL & Alignment</div>
  <div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('reasoning')">Reasoning</div>
  <div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('generation')">Generation</div>
  <div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('applications')">Applications</div>
  <div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('agents')">Agents</div>
  <div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('eval')">Evaluation</div>
  <div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('interpretability')">Interpretability</div>
  <div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('advanced')">Advanced</div>
  <div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('courses')">Courses</div>
  <div class="nav-item" onclick="scrollToSection('tools')">Tools</div>
</nav>

<!-- CONTROLS -->
<div class="controls">
  <div class="search-wrap">
    <span class="search-icon">⌕</span>
    <input type="text" id="searchInput" placeholder="Search topics, papers, authors..." oninput="filterContent()">
  </div>
  <div class="filter-group" id="typeFilters">
    <button class="filter-btn active" onclick="setTypeFilter('all', this)">All</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" onclick="setTypeFilter('paper', this)">Papers</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" onclick="setTypeFilter('book', this)">Books</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" onclick="setTypeFilter('course', this)">Courses</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" onclick="setTypeFilter('article', this)">Articles</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" onclick="setTypeFilter('youtube', this)">YouTube</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" onclick="setTypeFilter('doc', this)">Docs</button>
  </div>
  <span class="results-count" id="resultsCount"></span>
</div>

<!-- ROADMAP -->
<section class="roadmap-section" id="roadmap">
  <div class="section-label">Learning Roadmap — 10 Phases</div>
  <div class="roadmap-phases">
    <div class="phase-card" onclick="scrollToSection('math')">
      <div class="phase-num">PHASE 01</div>
      <div class="phase-title" style="color:var(--cat-math)">Math Foundations</div>
      <div class="phase-desc">Linear algebra, probability, information theory, optimization, calculus — the bedrock everything else builds on.</div>
      <div class="phase-topics">
        <span class="phase-topic-tag">SVD/PCA</span><span class="phase-topic-tag">Entropy</span><span class="phase-topic-tag">KL Divergence</span><span class="phase-topic-tag">Adam</span><span class="phase-topic-tag">Backprop</span><span class="phase-topic-tag">MLE</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="phase-card" onclick="scrollToSection('fundamentals')">
      <div class="phase-num">PHASE 02</div>
      <div class="phase-title" style="color:var(--cat-fundamentals)">NLP Fundamentals</div>
      <div class="phase-desc">Tokenization, POS tagging, NER, parsing — the linguistic and text processing pipeline.</div>
      <div class="phase-topics">
        <span class="phase-topic-tag">BPE</span><span class="phase-topic-tag">Tokenization</span><span class="phase-topic-tag">NER</span><span class="phase-topic-tag">Parsing</span><span class="phase-topic-tag">SentencePiece</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="phase-card" onclick="scrollToSection('classical')">
      <div class="phase-num">PHASE 03</div>
      <div class="phase-title" style="color:var(--cat-classical)">Classical NLP</div>
      <div class="phase-desc">N-gram models, HMMs, CRFs, TF-IDF, LDA — understanding where modern NLP came from.</div>
      <div class="phase-topics">
        <span class="phase-topic-tag">n-grams</span><span
